    <div class="content-container">
        <div class="text-content">
            <h2 class="section-title">Who Needs FSSAI State License in Delhi?</h2>
            <div class="content-text">
                
                <p>Restaurants, cafes, and dhabas across Delhi - from Connaught Place to Kamla Nagar and Karol Bagh - with turnover above Rs 12 lakh need State License. A Karol Bagh bakery with Rs 18 lakh annual turnover requires State License, not Basic Registration.</p>
                <p>Cloud kitchens in Dwarka, Rohini, and Saket with revenue above Rs 12 lakh require State License. FoSCoS allows a single State License to cover up to 10 brands from one kitchen address - valuable for Delhi's multi-brand virtual restaurant operators on Zomato and Swiggy.</p>
                <p>Food manufacturers in Okhla, Bawana, and Wazirpur producing 101 kg to 2 MT per day need State License. Caterers serving Delhi's corporate offices, weddings, and institutions with turnover above Rs 12 lakh also require State License. Wholesalers at Azadpur Mandi and Khari Baoli with turnover Rs 12 lakh-Rs 20 crore need State License.</p>

