<section class="steps-section" id="procedure-section">
    <div class="section-container">
        <header class="section-header" style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:48px;">
            <span class="section-eyebrow">Our Process</span>
            <h2 class="section-title">How to Get FSSAI State License in Delhi - 7 Steps</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle" style="text-align:left;max-width:100%;">Expert FSSAI State License from Patron's Rohini office - Form B, FSMS plan, pre-inspection readiness, and Designated Officer follow-up.</p>
        </header>
        <div class="steps-container">
            <div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 1</span><h3 class="step-title">Determine License Category and KoB</h3><p class="step-description">Confirm State License eligibility: turnover Rs 12 lakh-Rs 20 crore, Delhi-only operations. On FoSCoS, select Delhi, choose Kind of Business (KoB). System auto-displays eligible license type and fee.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Category Confirmed</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>KoB Selected</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="20" y="15" width="80" height="55" rx="6" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5"/><text x="60" y="35" font-size="7" fill="#14365F" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">CATEGORY</text><rect x="30" y="42" width="55" height="18" rx="3" fill="#FFF3E0" stroke="#F5A623" stroke-width="1"/><text x="58" y="54" font-size="6" fill="#E8712C" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Rs12L-Rs20Cr</text></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Eligibility Done</span><span class="step-number-large">01</span></div></div></div>

